The project based on Twill CMS v3 as CMS and blog engine.  
"area17/twill": "^3.4"
Documentation can be find here https://twillcms.com/guides/page-builder-with-blade/index.html
Always try to implement best practices suggested by Twill developers
We are using "mcamara/laravel-localization": "^2.3" For localization. 
EN - is default locale, prefix isn't used for this locale. 
URL examples: /blog/tag/data-science , /es/blog/tag/ciencia-de-datos ,  /ru/blog/tag/nauka-o-dannyh


      
    
        
